<title>JAPAN: Kadoya Sesame - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kadoya Sesame - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.45		vs	    6.83</p>
<p> Operating	  112    million    vs	  839    million</p>
<p> Current	     79    million    vs	  874    million</p>
<p> Net		   25    million    vs	  422    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.02 yen	  vs	   50.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kadoya Sesame Mills Inc is a manufacturer and wholesaler of sesame oil and sesame products.</p>
